<title>HONG KONG: HK dollar Nov M3 rises 22.8 pct year on year.</title>
<headline>HK dollar Nov M3 rises 22.8 pct year on year.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-12-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Hong Kong Monetary Authority gave the following money supply figures on Monday as percentage changes:</p>
<p>				   Nov '96    Oct '96    Nov '95</p>
<p> HK dollar M3 (year-on-year)   +22.8	+14.8	+13.5</p>
<p> HK dollar M3 (month)	     +5.0	 +2.6	 -1.9</p>
<p> HK dollar M1 (year-on-year)   +10.1	+10.2	 +1.6</p>
<p> HK dollar M1 (month)	     -0.7	 +0.9	 -0.6</p>
<p> HK dollar M2 (year-on-year)   +23.2	+15.0	+13.7</p>
<p> HK dollar M2 (month)	     +5.0	 +2.6	 -2.0</p>
<p>Loans to finance visible trade of Hong Kong (year-on-year)</p>
<p>				     +6.3	 +5.3	+20.1</p>
<p>Other loans for use in Hong Kong (year-on-year)</p>
<p>				    +18.5	+14.6	+11.3</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6441</p>
</text>
